{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17166","headline":"刘绍相访夜话因书即事 · 权德舆","name":"刘绍相访夜话因书即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人怆久别，兹夕欵郊扉。\n山僮漉野醖，穉子褰书帷。\n清露泫珠莹，金波流玉徽。\n忘言我造适，瞪视君无违。\n但令静胜躁，自使癯者肥。\n不待蘧生年，从此知昔非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}